# A CLI deploy (vercel deploy) does not honour .gitignore; without this file it
# swept 19,777 files and 1.5 GB of local build output into the upload on
# 2026-11-24 and the cold build ran out of memory. Git deploys ignore this file.
.next
.next-e2e*
node_modules
e2e/.results
e2e/.auth
e2e/test-results
playwright-report
.env*
graphify-out
.graphify
imports/private
